<section class="sec" id="host">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="kicker">For colleges and universities</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Bring the Hult Prize <em>to your campus</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">Hosting is light on staff time. Your students run the program, and Hult Prize Nepal trains and supports them at every step.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="host-grid">
      <div class="panel pink reveal"><h3>Your students do</h3><ul><li>Form an Organizing Committee and appoint a Campus Director</li><li>Promote the program and register teams</li><li>Run workshops, mock pitches and the Grand Finale</li><li>Invite judges, speakers and local partners</li></ul></div>
      <div class="panel navy reveal d1"><h3>Hult Prize Nepal does</h3><ul><li>Registers your campus on the global Hult Prize platform</li><li>Trains your Organizing Committee</li><li>Shares templates, workshop material and judging rubrics</li><li>Runs workshops on business models and pitching for qualified teams</li><li>Takes your winning team forward to Nationals</li></ul></div>
    </div>
    <div class="steps6">
      <div class="s6 reveal"><b>1</b><h4>Express interest</h4><p>Contact the national team and we set up a short orientation call.</p></div>
      <div class="s6 reveal d1"><b>2</b><h4>Register on the platform</h4><p>We guide you through official registration as a recognized OnCampus site.</p></div>
      <div class="s6 reveal d2"><b>3</b><h4>Form your committee</h4><p>Recruit 8 to 15 motivated students from different departments.</p></div>
      <div class="s6 reveal"><b>4</b><h4>Plan and launch</h4><p>Set your timeline, hold a launch event and open registration.</p></div>
      <div class="s6 reveal d1"><b>5</b><h4>Run the program</h4><p>Workshops, community events, mock pitches and your Grand Finale, before the end of February 2027.</p></div>
      <div class="s6 reveal d2"><b>6</b><h4>Send your best to Nationals</h4><p>Your winning team joins the National Competition in the last week of April 2027.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="benefits">
      <div class="ben reveal"><h3>For students</h3><div class="ben-list"><div><b>Real-world skills</b><span>Entrepreneurship, teamwork, leadership and pitching.</span></div><div><b>Training and mentoring</b><span>SDGs, design thinking, business models and finance.</span></div><div><b>A path to the world stage</b><span>Nationals, Digital Incubator, UK Accelerator, US$1M.</span></div><div><b>Workshops</b><span>Business models, pitching and startup finance before Nationals.</span></div><div><b>Recognition</b><span>Certificates, media exposure and a national stage.</span></div><div><b>A lifelong network</b><span>Peers from 45+ colleges and 1M+ Hult Prize alumni.</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="ben reveal d1"><h3>For your university</h3><div class="ben-list"><div><b>A hub for social innovation</b><span>Known as a college where ideas become ventures.</span></div><div><b>Learning beyond the classroom</b><span>Project-based learning tied to the SDGs.</span></div><div><b>Global visibility</b><span>Listed as an official OnCampus site on the Hult Prize platform.</span></div><div><b>Student leadership</b><span>8 to 15 students gain real organizing experience.</span></div><div><b>New partnerships</b><span>Industry judges, sponsors, incubators and NGOs.</span></div><div><b>Your name at Nationals</b><span>Your winners represent you alongside 40+ campuses.</span></div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel light reveal" style="margin-top:28px"><h3>Who can host?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted)">Any college or university in Nepal, of any size or location, across engineering, management, science, arts, law, health and education. You need a group of motivated students, support or at least awareness from the administration, at least one pitching event open to all students, and a commitment to innovation, impact and integrity. <b>Suggested timing:</b> register in October–November, run workshops in December–January, hold the Grand Finale by February 2027.</p></div>
    <p class="quote reveal">The Hult Prize OnCampus program does not just create competitors. It creates changemakers who carry the spirit of the SDGs beyond the stage.</p>
  </div>
</section>

